      "content": "This is the last abort check, but preparation still performs asynchronous seeding, validation, rebuilding, and preview generation afterward. If Cancel is pressed during any of those operations (for example, while `rebuildCandidate` is pending), the method returns `Prepared` and leaves the candidate instead of returning `Cancelled` and deleting it. Add cancellation checkpoints during the remaining phases and at least before returning `Prepared`, with the same candidate cleanup, and cover a late-stage abort in a regression test.",
